{
  "schemaVersion": 1,
  "game": "hsr",
  "id": "letter-from-the-fairies",
  "name": "Letter from the Fairies",
  "sourceUrl": "https://honkai-star-rail.fandom.com/wiki/Letter_from_the_Fairies",
  "scrapedAt": "2026-08-02T09:05:40.465Z",
  "volumes": [
    {
      "id": "1",
      "volumeKey": "the-first-letter",
      "label": "The First Letter",
      "document": {
        "version": 1,
        "blocks": [
          {
            "type": "paragraph",
            "children": [
              {
                "type": "text",
                "text": "To our friend from the outside, (Trailblazer):"
              }
            ],
            "id": "p-4c41db915b4aaf49"
          },
          {
            "type": "paragraph",
            "children": [
              {
                "type": "text",
                "text": "Do come and make friends with the fairies, mem!"
              },
              {
                "type": "br"
              },
              {
                "type": "text",
                "text": "Everyone here is warm and welcoming."
              },
              {
                "type": "br"
              },
              {
                "type": "text",
                "text": "Remember, only children with pure hearts"
              },
              {
                "type": "br"
              },
              {
                "type": "text",
                "text": "can ever find the path to the Maze."
              },
              {
                "type": "br"
              },
              {
                "type": "br"
              },
              {
                "type": "br"
              },
              {
                "type": "text",
                "text": "I've included some little gifts with this letter."
              },
              {
                "type": "br"
              },
              {
                "type": "text",
                "text": "Hope you have a wonderful time in the Maze, mem!"
              }
            ],
            "id": "p-a404d1c918888253"
          },
          {
            "type": "paragraph",
            "children": [
              {
                "type": "text",
                "text": "Spoken by Dolimem, penned by Relimem"
              }
            ],
            "id": "p-dc0c5d035fecb4f0"
          }
        ]
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "2",
      "volumeKey": "the-second-letter",
      "label": "The Second Letter",
      "document": {
        "version": 1,
        "blocks": [
          {
            "type": "paragraph",
            "children": [
              {
                "type": "text",
                "text": "Dear (Trailblazer):"
              }
            ],
            "id": "p-26b9c09ce2ac4bd1"
          },
          {
            "type": "paragraph",
            "children": [
              {
                "type": "text",
                "text": "The Chief said you've visited many places"
              },
              {
                "type": "br"
              },
              {
                "type": "text",
                "text": "and gone through countless adventures."
              },
              {
                "type": "br"
              },
              {
                "type": "text",
                "text": "I would love to sit by the tree hollow"
              },
              {
                "type": "br"
              },
              {
                "type": "text",
                "text": "and hear all about your amazing travels."
              },
              {
                "type": "br"
              },
              {
                "type": "br"
              },
              {
                "type": "br"
              },
              {
                "type": "text",
                "text": "The Great Tree will remember your stories,"
              },
              {
                "type": "br"
              },
              {
                "type": "text",
                "text": "and so will I."
              }
            ],
            "id": "p-8c46c216c0453fbc"
          },
          {
            "type": "paragraph",
            "children": [
              {
                "type": "text",
                "text": "Your biggest fan, Latitimem"
              }
            ],
            "id": "p-db9b52afdfdce27d"
          }
        ]
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "3",
      "volumeKey": "the-third-letter",
      "label": "The Third Letter",
      "document": {
        "version": 1,
        "blocks": [
          {
            "type": "paragraph",
            "children": [
              {
                "type": "text",
                "text": "To my friend (Trailblazer):"
              }
            ],
            "id": "p-6917b4a22411e28b"
          },
          {
            "type": "paragraph",
            "children": [
              {
                "type": "text",
                "text": "Did you know flowers have their own moods?"
              },
              {
                "type": "br"
              },
              {
                "type": "text",
                "text": "They stand tall and proud when happy,"
              },
              {
                "type": "br"
              },
              {
                "type": "text",
                "text": "and droop their heads when feeling sad."
              },
              {
                "type": "br"
              },
              {
                "type": "text",
                "text": "As their gardener, I take good care of them all."
              },
              {
                "type": "br"
              },
              {
                "type": "text",
                "text": "Whoever looks down gets a nice splash of water."
              },
              {
                "type": "br"
              },
              {
                "type": "br"
              },
              {
                "type": "br"
              },
              {
                "type": "text",
                "text": "Since your arrival, I've made a giant watering can."
              },
              {
                "type": "br"
              },
              {
                "type": "text",
                "text": "Its powerful streams wash away mountains of worries."
              },
              {
                "type": "br"
              },
              {
                "type": "text",
                "text": "As your friend, I want to take the best care of you."
              },
              {
                "type": "br"
              },
              {
                "type": "br"
              },
              {
                "type": "br"
              },
              {
                "type": "text",
                "text": "Your caring friend, Solimem"
              }
            ],
            "id": "p-8becb0ec60957d0f"
          }
        ]
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "4",
      "volumeKey": "the-fourth-letter",
      "label": "The Fourth Letter",
      "document": {
        "version": 1,
        "blocks": [
          {
            "type": "paragraph",
            "children": [
              {
                "type": "text",
                "text": "Welcome, (Trailblazer):"
              }
            ],
            "id": "p-937e219658ee46c3"
          },
          {
            "type": "paragraph",
            "children": [
              {
                "type": "text",
                "text": "My absolute favorite thing is celebrating festivals."
              },
              {
                "type": "br"
              },
              {
                "type": "text",
                "text": "When everyone gathers, singing songs and dancing together."
              },
              {
                "type": "br"
              },
              {
                "type": "text",
                "text": "I wish time would fly by even faster,"
              },
              {
                "type": "br"
              },
              {
                "type": "text",
                "text": "so I could teach you fairy dances at our next gathering."
              },
              {
                "type": "br"
              },
              {
                "type": "br"
              },
              {
                "type": "br"
              },
              {
                "type": "text",
                "text": "Yet once the celebration starts, I find myself wishing"
              },
              {
                "type": "br"
              },
              {
                "type": "text",
                "text": "that time would slow down, just a little bit more."
              },
              {
                "type": "br"
              },
              {
                "type": "text",
                "text": "Not because I want more Lantern Persimmons or Quillorbs,"
              },
              {
                "type": "br"
              },
              {
                "type": "text",
                "text": "but simply to enjoy more moments with friends."
              }
            ],
            "id": "p-61f7df7ad8b70d40"
          },
          {
            "type": "paragraph",
            "children": [
              {
                "type": "text",
                "text": "Lalimem, who wants to hang out with you"
              }
            ],
            "id": "p-54716f8182732125"
          }
        ]
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "5",
      "volumeKey": "the-fifth-letter",
      "label": "The Fifth Letter",
      "document": {
        "version": 1,
        "blocks": [
          {
            "type": "paragraph",
            "children": [
              {
                "type": "text",
                "text": "To (Trailblazer), who traveled from afar:"
              }
            ],
            "id": "p-b41e39e1db600d9b"
          },
          {
            "type": "paragraph",
            "children": [
              {
                "type": "text",
                "text": "I keep many little booklets,"
              },
              {
                "type": "br"
              },
              {
                "type": "text",
                "text": "each named after one of my friends."
              },
              {
                "type": "br"
              },
              {
                "type": "text",
                "text": "Every happy moment we share together"
              },
              {
                "type": "br"
              },
              {
                "type": "text",
                "text": "gets carefully recorded inside."
              },
              {
                "type": "br"
              },
              {
                "type": "text",
                "text": "These heavy pages hold the precious weight of memories."
              },
              {
                "type": "br"
              },
              {
                "type": "br"
              },
              {
                "type": "br"
              },
              {
                "type": "text",
                "text": "I've set aside an especially big, thick booklet just for you,"
              },
              {
                "type": "br"
              },
              {
                "type": "text",
                "text": "since joy is never in short supply when we're together."
              }
            ],
            "id": "p-3d02f4623fbdd25c"
          },
          {
            "type": "paragraph",
            "children": [
              {
                "type": "text",
                "text": "With enthusiasm, Tilamem"
              }
            ],
            "id": "p-3de5f08da004c7bb"
          }
        ]
      }
    }
  ]
}
